        <mxCell id="a2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#6B7280;" value="Owns: mandate-registry · chain-gateway · signer-service  ·  the only module that touches an RPC node or a key  ·  split from Straitsx.drawio, derived from docs/execution_plan.md §4 and §6" vertex="1">
